@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.1.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.1.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.1.0 (2026-11-20): Scope stage only (one stage per version). Built from the review of the two decks and pages against the book's own text (story ST11_Review_And_Plan): 7 and 8 percent of code lines come from the book; every code slide splits its code over 2 to 4 boxes; 16 of 18 (ch10) and 14 of 19 (ch11) slide codes equal the page example. Owner's ruling of 2026-11-20 17:50: the book's interactive-shell examples are rewritten as plain programs without the interpreter (option C); an exact copy of the book is not required, the standards are kept. L-113 dispositions of the six objections: (1) unusable slides - Areas Code and Deck; (2) made-up code - Area Code; (3) complicated, extra - Area Code; (4) split boxes - Area Deck; (5) slide and page differ - Area Source; (6) page as running place - Area Page."""@en .

ex:Scope11 a backlog:ScopeStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 10 and 11: the book's own code, one source, slide and page identical"@en ;
    backlog:scopeForMission ex:Mission11 ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_OwnerStated ; backlog:scopeCompletionState backlog:Proposed ;
    backlog:coversArea ex:Area11_Code, ex:Area11_Source, ex:Area11_Deck, ex:Area11_Page, ex:Area11_Release ;
    backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del11_Code_10, ex:Del11_Code_11, ex:Del11_Source_10, ex:Del11_Source_11, ex:Del11_Deck_10, ex:Del11_Deck_11, ex:Del11_Page_10, ex:Del11_Page_11, ex:Del11_Release_10, ex:Del11_Release_11 ;
    backlog:hasScopeExclusion ex:Excl11_Content, ex:Excl11_Chapters, ex:Excl11_SlideCount ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "IN: chapters 10 (Reading and Writing Files) and 11 (Organizing Files). (a) Code: every example comes from the book's own code for the subject taught, short, one program, no extras; the book's interactive-shell examples become plain programs with the result as a comment, no prompts; test set-up moves out of the visible code into a hidden page step. (b) Source: one source file per chapter holds each example once; the slide, the page example and the Slide code tab are generated from it, so they cannot differ. (c) Deck: each code sits whole in one box, copyable in one step; explanations sit beside or below it, not between code chunks; results show as the real output. (d) Page: every example of the deck runs on the page in slide order, with its explanation, so a session needs no other tool. (e) Release: automatic checks (code equals source on slide and page, one box per code, every example runs) and recorded reviews on teachability, understandability, explainability and human communication."@en .
ex:Area11_Code a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Examples taken from the book, short, plain programs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Area11_Source a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "One source per chapter feeding slide, page and Slide code tab"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Area11_Deck a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Decks: one whole code box per slide, readable results"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Area11_Page a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Pages: the place that shows, explains and runs every code"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Area11_Release a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Automatic checks and recorded reviews before release"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:Del11_Code_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 example list traced to the book's sections"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Code .
ex:Del11_Code_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 11 example list traced to the book's sections"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Code .
ex:Del11_Source_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 single code source"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Source .
ex:Del11_Source_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 11 single code source"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Source .
ex:Del11_Deck_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 deck, new version"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Deck .
ex:Del11_Deck_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 11 deck, new version"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Deck .
ex:Del11_Page_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 10 page, new version, with its page test result"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Page .
ex:Del11_Page_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Chapter 11 page, new version, with its page test result"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Page .
ex:Del11_Release_10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Check logs and review record of chapter 10"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Release .
ex:Del11_Release_11 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Check logs and review record of chapter 11"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area11_Release .
ex:Excl11_Content a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Changes to what the chapters teach, their stories and notes' meaning"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "Only the code, its presentation and its match with the page change. Story repeats are reported to the owner, not changed." .
ex:Excl11_Chapters a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "All other chapters, the lab-materials package and chapters 16-17 work"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "One narrow lineage per slice; Lineage10 is paused by the urgency and the lab package is queued." .
ex:Excl11_SlideCount a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Adding slides"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "Each section must fit one 4-hour time-box; fuller text uses balloons on existing slides." .
